prompt_template:
Create a finished premium street-culture editorial poster as a single raster image, aspect ratio {ASPECT_RATIO}. The image itself fills the canvas, no mockup or outer frame. Visual priorities:
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Subject: {SUBJECT}. Action: {ACTION}
Design intention and ratio-specific flow: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Exact copy, each string once: huge vermilion-orange headline "{MAIN_TEXT}"; substantial black condensed secondary "{SECONDARY_TEXT}"; small readable editorial note "{NOTE_TEXT}" inside one thin hand-drawn oval; handwritten accent "{HAND_TEXT}"; small footer "{FOOTER_TEXT}". Preserve spelling and punctuation; no other copy. Make actual letterforms dense and expressive; keep main words decipherable even with partial subject overlap. Natural photographic skin and fabric, clean cutout edges, subtle contact shadows. Small sparse ink flecks and subtle fold wear only within large orange printed letters, about 2 percent coverage; white paper stays clean. A few electric-blue marker strokes punctuate movement. Do not use generic centered template composition. Replace this source content completely: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}. No logos, watermarks, unreadable pseudo-text, extra limbs, fused fingers, fake cutout outlines, gradients behind the subject or realistic room backdrop.
